  "description": "OpenTelemetry Collector self-observability across the cluster's pod, node, and cluster collectors: receiver acceptance, processor throughput, exporter queues, and process health. The OTel project publishes no production-collector dashboard, so this custom dashboard references only the otelcol_* metrics verified against the opentelemetry-collector source (receiver/exporter/processor generated telemetry and service process metrics). Panel queries use the collectors' raw exposition names: the OTel project's telemetry renders its counter instruments without the Prometheus `_total` suffix (e.g. `otelcol_process_uptime`, `otelcol_processor_incoming_items`), and VictoriaMetrics stores the OTLP-exported samples verbatim with -opentelemetry.usePrometheusNaming removed \u2014 verified live against the ingested name set.",
